    "subject": "审查请求：修复 menuButtons DataCloneError",
    "context": "#004",
    "content": "## 审查重点\n\n### 问题\n`menuButtons` 来自 `appContext.route.items[...].menuButtons`，是 Vue reactive Proxy 数组，postMessage 结构化克隆失败：\n```\nDataCloneError: Failed to execute 'postMessage' on 'Window': [object Array] could not be cloned.\n```\n\n### 修复\n`app.js` 第 180 行，展开为普通数组：\n```javascript\n// 改前\nmenuButtons: menuButtons\n// 改后\nmenuButtons: [...menuButtons]\n```\n\n与之前 Bug #2 的 `toRaw(userInfo)` 修复同一类问题（Vue Proxy 无法序列化）。",
    "files": [
      "caikuangzi01.huoguan_erp/trunk/IChainStar.Infrastructure.Frontend/wwwroot/js/app.js"
    ]
  }
}
